WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.033
-Welcome back, everybody!

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:03.534
We are talking
with Caroline Rhea,

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:06.200
who will be performing at the
Epic Events Center in Green Bay

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.000
on November 18th.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.834
I just noticed your shirt.
Very nice.

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.267
-I identify as a witch.

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:13.601
-Yes, that's perfect.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:15.767
That's perfect for you
and for Halloween.

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:17.400
-I know.
-You -- obviously,

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.501
"Sabrina the Teenage Witch,"

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:20.267
which by the way,
should come back.

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:21.734
Or let's do a holiday movie.

00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:23.400
-Yeah! Come on.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.567
Seriously.
Okay. Can I tell you the most

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:26.868
embarrassing thing
that happened today

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:28.901
'cause I'm so
technologically stupid?

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:30.167
[ Cheers ]

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.767
And I played a witch
for a long time.

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:32.834
-Yeah.
-So, I went to buy

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:35.467
Halloween candy,
and I had my credit card.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:38.200
And I was trying
to figure out the machine.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.567
And the girl said, "That's okay,
you can just tap your card."

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.000
And I went like this.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:47.167
[ Rim shot ]
-Oh, my God.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:49.234
-I know!
-Oh, my God.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:51.334
-And she looked at me like,
"What? What?"

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.033
-And you're like...
-And I was like,

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:55.267
"It worked on 'Sabrina'
for a really long time."

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:56.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:57.667
Like, I was, like,
tapping the card.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:59.367
Oh, I know.
It's very embarrassing.

00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:00.901
-I'm so psyched you're here.

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:02.801
And it was so fun to see you
at Dave's thing.

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:05.067
-You were so funny, Jimmy!
-No, you -- I was not --

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:06.701
-You have to get --
no, you have to do one minute

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:08.400
of Gilbert Gottfried.
Come on.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.567
-Oh, my God.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:10.767
-One minute!

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:13.501
He was so funny.
It was so good.

00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:16.033
-[ As Gilbert Gottfried ]
"Caroline Rhea, everybody!"

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:18.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.901
[ Normal voice ]
Caroline Rhea.

00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:22.767
Go see her at the
Epic Events Center in Green Bay,

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:24.634
on November 18th.

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:25.801
You are the greatest.
Thank you so much

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:26.968
for coming out.
-Thank you so much, Jimmy.

